text Monday...
text I suddenly feel lethargic.
text It's the start to another week of having to sit through one tedious class after the next.
text @[Tomoya]
text (Maybe I'd feel more motivated if I just dropped out and started working...)
text I don't know. Would I really...?
text No, I really don't see that happening.
text I feel like mindlessly sitting through lectures would probably be easier overall.
text Working every day just to put food on the table...?
text Once I got myself stuck in that cycle, I would never be able to walk away from it, no matter how pathetic I felt.
text Just the thought makes me cringe a little.
text @[Tomoya]
text (But even so, I only have a year left...)
text I look at the clock. It's still early. I'll have plenty of time to make first bell.
text @[Tomoya]
text (Of course, I'm not sure I really want to make it there in time. I'd have to put up with classes the entire day, then...)
